## 1.  THE DEFECT

`dev_sgi_re.c`, `DEVICE_ACCESS(sgi_re)`.  Six address windows each end with:

    } else {
            fatal("TODO: read from CRIME_RE_<window>\n");
            exit(1);
    }

A legal guest **`ld`** (8-byte load) from any of the six ends the emulator.

