13380| > execute**. A round that de-fatalised it would be editing unreachable code and its detector
13381| > could carry no row �?" the vacuous shape in its purest form. The census is what stops that
13382| > being attempted.
13383| 
13384| **Honest bound:** reachability is derived from address-decode reading, not measured, *except*
13385| for the WIDTH class, which now has the witness above. DIRECTION, BADVAL and BADOFFSET have no
13386| witness, and a round on any of them owes one first.
13387| 
